    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Longīnus</span></b> , i, m.
		longus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a Roman surname in the</i> gens
			Cassia.—So, Cassius Longinus, v.
			Cassius.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Grecian philosopher, minister of Zenobia, who was
				put to death by Aurelian</i>, <i><span class="en">Vop. Aur.
				30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 95</span></i>.</div>
